  "description": "More comfort. More range. More adventure.\nThe new ADVENTR 6 bridges the gap between daily use and adventure, between entry-level and ambition, between eFully and eTrekking bike. With 120 mm travel in the front, 100 mm in the rear, a RockShox suspension setup, and a dropper post, you're equally confident on forest trails and the ride to work. The newly developed, high-performance Bosch Performance Line PX motor offers smooth, powerful assistance, while the large 800 Wh battery delivers serious range—even when you're heading far off the beaten track. Shimano CUES shifting, the Kiox 300 display, and LED Remote provide mechanical precision and digital control. All of this is built into a new frame platform designed for comfort, versatility, and a system weight of up to 150 kg. In short: the ADVENTR 6 is made for those who want more - without being tied to a single path.",
